    m_Key: Tap PICK to grab the item you are aiming at.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039279
    m_Key: Aim the + at any item on the floor. PICK appears when you can grab it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039280
    m_Key: Pick up an item first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039281
    m_Key: Tap PLACE. The first item on a rack decides what that rack holds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039282
    m_Key: Walk to the marked rack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039283
    m_Key: m), then aim the + anywhere on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
