    m_Key: Nice! This rack now holds that item type.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039289
    m_Key: DROP throws one item gently forward. Select a type in your hand to use
      SEARCH or MAGNET. Get tools with cash, optional reward videos or the store.
      Tap GOT IT to continue.
