    m_Key: Aim at an outlined item. Tap PICK for one item, or hold to collect more
      of that type.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039299
    m_Key: Hands start with 10 slots. DROP drops one selected item per tap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039300
    m_Key: SORT YOUR RACKS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039301
    m_Key: Tap an inventory category to select it. Aim at a green rack and tap or
      hold PLACE.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8216963039302
    m_Key: The first item assigns the whole rack. Pick all its items back up to reset
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
